@prefix wiki:  <https://pod.vardeman.me/vault/ontology/wiki#> .
@prefix sh:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

</vault/meta/affordances/org-find-by-ror.ttl>
    a wiki:Affordance ;
    sh:agentInstruction """
      Canonical institutional identity lookup via ROR (Research Organization
      Registry) IRI. Use this when an external source provides a ROR identifier
      (e.g., from a funding record or ORCID affiliation) and you need the local
      Organization card.

      Parameter: $ror — the full ROR IRI as a named node, e.g.,
      <https://ror.org/00mkhxb43> (University of Notre Dame).
      Pass the angle-bracketed form in SPARQL; the affordance engine substitutes
      it as an IRI.

      Sources: Organization cards at /vault/contacts/Organization/*/index.ttl.
      Enumerate via LDP listing of </vault/contacts/Organization/> or use
      Comunica link-traversal with the Organization container as entry point.

      Returns 0..1 ?org IRIs. Zero means no Organization card exists for this
      ROR; the agent should prompt to create a stub card via the addressbook
      overlay templates.
    """ ;
    wiki:selectQuery """
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>

SELECT ?org WHERE {
  ?org owl:sameAs $ror .
}
    """ .
